-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 8.9.1998 (ארגון המורים): the wage agreement for
-- 1.10.97–31.12.98 between the State, the local authorities and the three
-- large cities, and ארגון המורים העל-יסודיים. Whom it covers and its period
-- (§§2–3); the reward for escorting trips and out-of-school activity in
-- activity units, each 0.7% of the monthly combined salary, by the hour an
-- activity ends (§4), within a cost of 1.2% (§5); the management, education
-- and profession allowances raised (§§6–8) within 1.9% (§9); contributions
-- to a provident fund on the components that are not pensionable, within
-- 0.8% (§10, carried out by the agreement of 17.12.98); the special
-- personal contracts of §21 of the agreement of 31.8.94 kept (§11); the
-- general provisions and the joint committee (§§12–13); and, as annex א',
-- §2 of the parity committee's decision of 25.11.86 on escorting trips.
--
-- The Oz LaTmura agreement of 14.8.2011, §21 (oz-founding-21), replaces its
-- §4.ד, its §4.ח and its annex א' for teachers under the reform in full and
-- leaves the rest standing; the agreement of 17.12.98
-- (l4/agreements/oz-latmura/1998-12-17_oz-latmura_provident-fund.l4) is an
-- annex to it. It speaks to no pay item of l4/lib/vocabulary.l4 and is not
-- in oz-latmura-root.l4.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `1994-08-31_oz-latmura_wage-supplements-1994`

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — תגמול בגין ליווי טיולים ופעילות חוץ בית ספרית (8.9.1998)`

DECLARE `1998 Oz agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the reward for out-of-school activity`
    `decide the further localities for special contracts`
    `act to apply the 1998 agreement to the owners' teaching employees`
    `raise a claim on contributions for components that are not pensionable`
    `negotiate further on pay and terms in the 1998 agreement's period`
    `strike or lock out over a matter the 1998 agreement settled`
    `decide disputes over the 1998 agreement unanimously`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The registration stamp (15.3.1999, no. 7066/98); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 A handwritten number; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The Hebrew date of signing; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The State and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The Centre of Local Government, for every local authority save the three large cities, its representative's name left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 The three large cities and who represents them; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 "All together and each apart"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 The employers' short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 "Side A"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 The organisation, its chair's name left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 The organisation's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 "Side B"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p15 A recital: the parties negotiated the teachers' pay and terms.
-- akn:preamble/p16 A recital: they set the understandings down in a collective agreement.
-- akn:preamble/p17 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

-- ¶5: the day of signing.
@ref akn:preamble/p5
`the 1998 Oz agreement was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 8 9 1998

§§ `1–3 מבוא, תחולה ותוקף`

-- akn:art_1 The heading of §1.
-- akn:art_2 The heading of §2.
-- akn:art_3 The heading of §3.

@ref akn:art_1/p1
`the 1998 Oz agreement's preamble and annexes are part of it` MEANS TRUE

-- 2.1: every employee in the teaching scale whom the organisation
-- represents ("עובדי הוראה"); 2.3: those in a sabbatical in תשנ"ח, and
-- from תשנ"ט on, among them.
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-1 akn:art_2__para_2-3
GIVEN `in the teaching scale` IS A BOOLEAN, `represented by the organisation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1998 Oz agreement applies to` `in the teaching scale` `represented by the organisation` IF
    `in the teaching scale` AND `represented by the organisation`

`the 1998 Oz agreement applies in a sabbatical from 5758` MEANS TRUE

-- 2.2: the government acts to apply it to the teachers of the "owners",
-- whom it supervises and funds.
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-2
`applying the 1998 agreement to the owners' teachers` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `act to apply the 1998 agreement to the owners' teaching employees`

-- §3: from 1.10.97 to 31.12.98, both days in (conventions dates.start and
-- dates.end).
@ref akn:art_3/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the 1998 Oz agreement's period` d IF
        d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 1997)
    AND d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 1998)

§§ `4 ליווי טיולים ופעילות חוץ בית ספרית`

-- akn:art_4 The heading of §4.

-- (א): from 1.9.98 the teaching employees are paid a reward for
-- out-of-school activity with pupils.
@ref akn:art_4__para_a
`the 1998 Oz reward for out-of-school activity starts on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1998

-- (ב): an out-of-school activity is one the teaching employees carry out
-- with pupils outside the education institution (a kindergarten among
-- them), and is one only of: (1)–(4) starting in the morning and ending,
-- after the teaching hours, between 14:00 and 15:00, 15:00 and 18:00,
-- 18:00 and 21:00, or 21:00 and 24:00; (5) a detached activity, between
-- 16:00 and 24:00; (6) an activity with a night away, from the morning to
-- the next day. Hours are numbers of the clock (18.5 is 18:30; past
-- midnight, 24.5 is 00:30): an activity ending past midnight with no night
-- away is in no kind, and is read with the last (F-oz-1998-b, below).
@ref akn:art_4__para_b akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_3 akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_4 akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_5 akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_6
DECLARE `1998 Oz out-of-school activity` IS ONE OF
    `a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` HAS `the hour it ends` IS A NUMBER
    `a 1998 detached activity`
    `a 1998 activity with nights away` HAS `the nights away` IS A NUMBER

GIVEN a IS A `1998 Oz out-of-school activity`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an out-of-school activity under the 1998 Oz agreement` a IF
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` h THEN h AT LEAST 14
    WHEN `a 1998 detached activity` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a 1998 activity with nights away` n THEN n AT LEAST 1

-- (ג): the reward is counted in activity units; a unit is worth 0.7% of
-- the teacher's monthly combined salary.
@ref akn:art_4__para_c
`the share of the monthly combined salary an activity unit is worth` MEANS 0.7%

GIVEN `the monthly combined salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the value of an activity unit under the 1998 Oz agreement` `the monthly combined salary` IS
    `the share of the monthly combined salary an activity unit is worth` TIMES `the monthly combined salary`

-- (ד): the units each activity earns go by the hour it ends: between 14:00
-- and 15:00, 0.5; between 15:00 and 18:00, 2; between 18:00 and 21:00, 3.5;
-- between 21:00 and 24:00, 5; a detached activity, 3; one with a night
-- away, 7. ¶2: each outing earns only the units beside the hour it ends,
-- never added up for one activity — save one with more than one night
-- away, whose units go by the nights.
-- F-oz-1998-a: "בין 14:00 לבין 15:00" and "בין 15:00 לבין 18:00" both
-- hold 15:00, and so at 18:00 and 21:00. The reading adopted (convention
-- thresholds.shared-bound): the hour belongs to the row that opens at it.
-- F-oz-1998-b: the table stops at 24:00, and an activity that ends later
-- with no night away is in no row. The reading adopted (convention
-- reading.analogy): the nearest row, 21:00 to 24:00.
@ref akn:art_4__para_d akn:art_4__para_d/t1 akn:art_4__para_d/p2
GIVEN h IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1998 table has a row for an activity ending at` h IF
    h AT LEAST 14 AND h AT MOST 24

GIVEN h IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the units the 1998 table gives an activity ending at` h IS
    BRANCH
        IF h `has reached the row from` 21 THEN 5
        IF h `has reached the row from` 18 THEN 3.5
        IF h `has reached the row from` 15 THEN 2
        IF h `has reached the row from` 14 THEN 0.5
        OTHERWISE 0

GIVEN a IS A `1998 Oz out-of-school activity`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the units a 1998 activity earns` a IS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` h THEN `the units the 1998 table gives an activity ending at` h
    WHEN `a 1998 detached activity` THEN 3
    WHEN `a 1998 activity with nights away` n THEN 7 TIMES max 1 n

-- (ה): the reward is paid with the salary for the month after the month
-- of the activity (convention dates.salary-month).
@ref akn:art_4__para_e
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER @desc the month of the activity
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the salary month the 1998 reward is paid with` y m IS
    IF m EQUALS 12
    THEN (LIST (y PLUS 1), 1)
    ELSE (LIST y, (m PLUS 1))

-- (ו): the reward is not salary for the hour value, the pension, the
-- training fund, the provident fund or severance pay.
@ref akn:art_4__para_f
DECLARE `what the 1998 reward might count for` IS ONE OF
    `the hour value`
    `the pension`
    `the training fund`
    `the provident fund`
    `severance pay`

GIVEN p IS A `what the 1998 reward might count for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1998 reward counts as salary for` p IF FALSE

-- (ז): from the arrangement's start every arrangement of earlier agreements
-- on paying the teachers for out-of-school activity, or for like activity,
-- is cancelled.
@ref akn:art_4__para_g
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the earlier out-of-school arrangements stand on` d IF
    NOT d `is on or after` `the 1998 Oz reward for out-of-school activity starts on`

-- (ח): notwithstanding (ז), for an activity on a day the teacher is not
-- employed in teaching, or is employed less than 4 hours, he is paid, on
-- top of this section's reward, by §2 of the parity committee's decision
-- of 25.11.86, which is annex א' (below). "פחות מ-4 שעות" is strict: 4
-- hours are not less than 4.
@ref akn:art_4__para_h
GIVEN `hours taught that day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `annex א' of the 1998 Oz agreement adds to the reward on a day of` `hours taught that day` IF
    `hours taught that day` LESS THAN 4

-- (ט): notwithstanding (ז), the section does not apply to the של"ח
-- teachers: the reward arrangement in force on the eve of the signing goes
-- on for them (outside the corpus).
@ref akn:art_4__para_i
GIVEN `a של"ח teacher` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§4 of the 1998 Oz agreement pays the teacher` `a של"ח teacher` IF
    NOT `a של"ח teacher`

`why the של"ח teachers' reward is not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "הסדר התגמול למורי של\"ח שהיה בתוקף ערב חתימת ההסכם הקיבוצי מיום 8.9.98"

-- (י): the section settles the organisation's claims on the out-of-school
-- activity named in §30 of the agreement of 11.5.93.
@ref akn:art_4__para_j
`§4 of the 1998 Oz agreement settles the claims of §30 of 11.5.93` MEANS TRUE

-- The reward for one activity: its units at a unit's value, for a teacher
-- §4 pays, from 1.9.98; annex א''s hours are on top, by (ח).
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      a IS A `1998 Oz out-of-school activity`
      `the monthly combined salary` IS A NUMBER
      `a של"ח teacher` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1998 Oz reward for an activity` d a `the monthly combined salary` `a של"ח teacher` IS
    IF     d `is on or after` `the 1998 Oz reward for out-of-school activity starts on`
       AND `§4 of the 1998 Oz agreement pays the teacher` `a של"ח teacher`
       AND `an out-of-school activity under the 1998 Oz agreement` a
    THEN `the units a 1998 activity earns` a TIMES `the value of an activity unit under the 1998 Oz agreement` `the monthly combined salary`
    ELSE 0

`paying the reward for out-of-school activity` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the reward for out-of-school activity`

§§ `5 עלות ומימון`

-- akn:art_5 The heading of §5.

-- 5.1: the cost of §4's supplements and benefits is 1.2% of the teachers'
-- salary determining the pension; 5.2: it comes from §5 of the agreement of
-- 31.8.94 (imported: half a percent a year for accrual-pension rights).
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-1 akn:art_5__para_5-2
`the cost of §4 of the 1998 Oz agreement` MEANS 1.2%

`the 1994 allocation §4's cost comes from` MEANS `the share of the pension salary the 1994 Oz agreement allocates in all`

§§ `6–9 גמולים ועלות הסכם השכר`

-- akn:art_6 The heading of §6.
-- akn:art_7 The heading of §7.
-- akn:art_8 The heading of §8.
-- akn:art_9 The heading of §9.

-- §6: from 1.1.98 the management allowance now paid to principals, deputy
-- principals and coordinating kindergarten teachers grows by 12.5%:
-- relatively (convention amounts.increase).
@ref akn:art_6/p1
`the rise of the management allowance under the 1998 Oz agreement` MEANS 12.5%

GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the allowance before the rise` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the management allowance under the 1998 Oz agreement on` d `the allowance before the rise` IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1998)
    THEN `the allowance before the rise` `increased by` `the rise of the management allowance under the 1998 Oz agreement`
    ELSE `the allowance before the rise`

-- §7: from 1.1.98 the education allowance paid at 5% ("גמול חינוך 5%")
-- rises to 9% of the combined salary and of the teaching-reinforcement
-- supplement of 1994 ("גמול חינוך 9%"); ¶2: its rules go on. §8: from
-- 1.1.98 the profession and training allowance rises to 5.75% of the same
-- base; ¶2: its rules go on. The rules of both are the agreements' of the
-- eve, outside the corpus.
@ref akn:art_7/p1 akn:art_7/p2 akn:art_8/p1 akn:art_8/p2
DECLARE `1998 Oz percentage allowance` IS ONE OF
    `the education allowance`
    `the profession and training allowance`

GIVEN g IS A `1998 Oz percentage allowance`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1998 Oz rate of` g IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `the education allowance` THEN 9%
    WHEN `the profession and training allowance` THEN 5.75%

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      g IS A `1998 Oz percentage allowance`
      `the combined salary` IS A NUMBER
      `the teaching-reinforcement supplement` IS A NUMBER @desc §6 of the agreement of 31.8.94, as updated
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1998 Oz allowance on` d g `the combined salary` `the teaching-reinforcement supplement` IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1998)
    THEN JUST (`the 1998 Oz rate of` g TIMES (`the combined salary` PLUS `the teaching-reinforcement supplement`))
    ELSE NOTHING

`the education allowance the 1998 Oz agreement raises from` MEANS 5%
`the rules of the raised allowances change under the 1998 Oz agreement` MEANS FALSE

-- §9: the cost of §§6–8 is 1.9% of the teachers' whole wage bill, and that
-- is the agreement's whole cost for 1.10.97–31.12.98.
@ref akn:art_9/p1 akn:art_9/p2
`the cost of §§6–8 of the 1998 Oz agreement` MEANS 1.9%

§§ `10 הכללת רכיבים לגמל`

-- akn:art_10 The heading of §10.

-- 10.1: for the time from 1.1.98 contributions are made to a provident fund
-- on the salary components and other payments that are not pensionable
-- and carry no contribution to the Dafna fund, save the tax gross-up and
-- the benefit imputed for tax, within 10.3's cost. 10.2: a provident fund
-- here is a fund for benefits under the Income Tax (Rules for Approving and
-- Running Provident Funds) Regulations, which the section dates 5754-1994
-- (the agreement of 17.12.98, §4, dates them 5724-1964); they are outside
-- the corpus.
@ref akn:art_10__para_10-1 akn:art_10__para_10-2
DECLARE `1998 Oz payment` IS ONE OF
    `a pensionable component`
    `a component carrying Dafna contributions`
    `a tax gross-up`
    `a benefit imputed for tax`
    `another component that is not pensionable`

GIVEN d IS A DATE, p IS A `1998 Oz payment`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§10 of the 1998 Oz agreement brings into the provident fund` d p IF
        d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1998)
    AND p EQUALS `another component that is not pensionable`

-- 10.3: the employer's share costs 0.8% of the teachers' salary
-- determining the pension in all; 10.4: it comes from §5 of the agreement
-- of 31.8.94; 10.5: this section exhausts that §5 fully and finally, and
-- the organisation raises no claim on contributions to a provident fund or
-- a pension on components that are not pensionable on its basis.
@ref akn:art_10__para_10-3 akn:art_10__para_10-4 akn:art_10__para_10-5 akn:art_10__para_10-5/p2
`the cost of the employer's provident-fund share under the 1998 Oz agreement` MEANS 0.8%

`the 1998 Oz agreement exhausts §5 of the 1994 agreement` MEANS TRUE

`no claim on §5 of the 1994 agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
    SHANT `raise a claim on contributions for components that are not pensionable`

-- The whole cost the 1998 agreement draws from §5 of the agreement of
-- 31.8.94: §4's 1.2% and §10's 0.8%.
`what the 1998 Oz agreement draws from §5 of 31.8.94` MEANS
    `the cost of §4 of the 1998 Oz agreement` PLUS `the cost of the employer's provident-fund share under the 1998 Oz agreement`

§§ `11 חוזים אישיים`

-- akn:art_11 The heading of §11.
-- akn:art_11/p4 A fax banner; no rule.
-- akn:art_11/p5 A fax banner; no rule.

-- ¶1: §21 of the agreement of 31.8.94 (imported), the quota included,
-- stands in this agreement (1998), with these changes. ¶2: entitled to the
-- personal contracts are the teachers who met the criteria set before
-- (§21's areas) and the teachers in further localities with special
-- educational needs, which a committee of the Ministry with the Treasury
-- decides within a month of the signing. ¶3: entitled are all the teachers
-- who meet the criteria published in the director-general's circular
-- נ"ט/1(א) of September 1998 (outside the corpus): a fact of the case.
@ref akn:art_11/p1 akn:art_11/p2 akn:art_11/p3
GIVEN `the area he teaches in` IS AN `area of the 1994 Oz special contracts`
      `in a further locality the committee decided` IS A BOOLEAN
      `meets the criteria of circular נ"ט/1(א)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to a special contract under the 1998 Oz agreement` `the area he teaches in` `in a further locality the committee decided` `meets the criteria of circular נ"ט/1(א)` IF
        `meets the criteria of circular נ"ט/1(א)`
    AND (   `§21 of the 1994 Oz agreement runs in` `the area he teaches in`
         OR `in a further locality the committee decided`)

`deciding the further localities` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `decide the further localities for special contracts`
    WITHIN DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 8 10 1998) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the 1998 Oz agreement was signed on`

§§ `12–13 הוראות כלליות ויישוב חילוקי דעות`

-- akn:art_12 The heading of §12.
-- akn:art_13 The heading of §13.

-- 12.1: the agreement exhausts all the parties' claims, national and
-- local, on pay and terms for its period; ¶2: no further negotiation on
-- them in its period.
@ref akn:art_12__para_12-1 akn:art_12__para_12-1/p2
`no further negotiation in the 1998 Oz agreement's period` MEANS
    PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
    SHANT `negotiate further on pay and terms in the 1998 agreement's period`

-- 12.2: earlier terms stand for its period unless it amends or cancels
-- them expressly or by implication; 12.3: the disputes on what it settles
-- are void on signing; 12.4: no strike or lockout, in full or in part, nor
-- organised harm to the work, over what it settles, in its period.
@ref akn:art_12__para_12-2
`earlier terms stand unless the 1998 Oz agreement changes them` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:art_12__para_12-3
`the disputes on the 1998 Oz agreement's matters stand` MEANS FALSE

@ref akn:art_12__para_12-4
`industrial peace under the 1998 Oz agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
    SHANT `strike or lock out over a matter the 1998 agreement settled`

-- §13: a joint committee of the wages commissioner, the Ministry's
-- director-general and the organisation's chair follows the agreement and
-- decides disputes on its meaning or its application unanimously (no
-- deadline: convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_13/p1
`deciding disputes over the 1998 Oz agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `decide disputes over the 1998 agreement unanimously`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signing formula; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The parties signing; no rule.

§§ `נספח א' — החלטת הוועדה הפריטטית מיום 25.11.86`

-- akn:attachments The annex: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 The annex's title: the text of §2 of the parity committee's decision of 25.11.86; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2 The heading of the decision's §2, escorts of trips.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2/p2 "Raphael's proposal is accepted"; the rule follows.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2/p8 The decision applied from 1.12.86; §4.ח applies it from 1.9.98.

-- ¶3–¶7: an escort paid for hours by the hours he taught that day: none,
-- 4; one, 3; two, 2; three, 1; four, none. (The Oz LaTmura agreement of
-- 14.8.2011, §21(ב), puts its own rule in this annex's place for teachers
-- under the reform in full.)
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2/p3 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2/p4 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2/p5 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2/p6 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2/p7
GIVEN `hours taught that day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hours annex א' of the 1998 Oz agreement pays an escort` `hours taught that day` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `hours taught that day` AT LEAST 4 THEN 0
        IF `hours taught that day` AT LEAST 3 THEN 1
        IF `hours taught that day` AT LEAST 2 THEN 2
        IF `hours taught that day` AT LEAST 1 THEN 3
        OTHERWISE 4

§§ `illustrations`

#ASSERT `in the 1998 Oz agreement's period` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 1997)
#ASSERT `in the 1998 Oz agreement's period` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 1998)
#ASSERT NOT `in the 1998 Oz agreement's period` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1999)

-- §4: a unit of 0.7% of 10,000 is 70; to 17:00, 2 units; to 20:00, 3.5; to
-- 23:00, 5; two nights away, 14; before 1.9.98 nothing; a של"ח teacher
-- nothing under §4.
#ASSERT `the value of an activity unit under the 1998 Oz agreement` 10000 EQUALS 70
#ASSERT `the units a 1998 activity earns` (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 14.5) EQUALS 0.5
#ASSERT `the units a 1998 activity earns` (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 17) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the units a 1998 activity earns` (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 20) EQUALS 3.5
#ASSERT `the units a 1998 activity earns` (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 23) EQUALS 5
#ASSERT `the units a 1998 activity earns` (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 13) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the units a 1998 activity earns` (`a 1998 activity with nights away` 2) EQUALS 14
#ASSERT `the units a 1998 activity earns` `a 1998 detached activity` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `the 1998 Oz reward for an activity` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 1998) (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 20) 10000 FALSE EQUALS 245
#ASSERT `the 1998 Oz reward for an activity` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 1998) (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 20) 10000 FALSE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the 1998 Oz reward for an activity` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 1998) (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 20) 10000 TRUE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the 1998 Oz reward for an activity` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 1998) (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 24.5) 10000 FALSE EQUALS 350
#ASSERT `the salary month the 1998 reward is paid with` 1998 12 EQUALS LIST 1999, 1
#ASSERT `the salary month the 1998 reward is paid with` 1998 10 EQUALS LIST 1998, 11
#ASSERT NOT `the 1998 reward counts as salary for` `the provident fund`
#ASSERT `the earlier out-of-school arrangements stand on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 1998)
#ASSERT NOT `the earlier out-of-school arrangements stand on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1998)
#ASSERT `annex א' of the 1998 Oz agreement adds to the reward on a day of` 3
#ASSERT NOT `annex א' of the 1998 Oz agreement adds to the reward on a day of` 4

-- §§5 and 10: 1.2% and 0.8% are the 2% §5 of the agreement of 31.8.94
-- allocates.
#ASSERT `what the 1998 Oz agreement draws from §5 of 31.8.94` EQUALS `the 1994 allocation §4's cost comes from`

-- §§6–8: an allowance of 10% becomes 11.25%; 9% and 5.75% of 10,000 and
-- 150.
#ASSERT `the management allowance under the 1998 Oz agreement on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1998) (10%) EQUALS 11.25%
#ASSERT `the management allowance under the 1998 Oz agreement on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 1997) (10%) EQUALS 10%
#ASSERT `the 1998 Oz allowance on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1998) `the education allowance` 10000 150 EQUALS JUST 913.5
#ASSERT `the 1998 Oz allowance on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1998) `the profession and training allowance` 10000 150 EQUALS JUST 583.625

-- §10: a component neither pensionable nor in Dafna, from 1.1.98.
#ASSERT `§10 of the 1998 Oz agreement brings into the provident fund` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1998) `another component that is not pensionable`
#ASSERT NOT `§10 of the 1998 Oz agreement brings into the provident fund` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1998) `a tax gross-up`
#ASSERT NOT `§10 of the 1998 Oz agreement brings into the provident fund` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 1997) `another component that is not pensionable`

-- §11: a confrontation-line teacher meeting the circular's criteria; one
-- elsewhere only in a locality the committee added; a month to decide.
#ASSERT `entitled to a special contract under the 1998 Oz agreement` `a confrontation-line locality` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `entitled to a special contract under the 1998 Oz agreement` `another place` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `entitled to a special contract under the 1998 Oz agreement` `another place` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 8 10 1998) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the 1998 Oz agreement was signed on` EQUALS 30

-- Annex א': three hours taught, one hour paid.
#ASSERT `the hours annex א' of the 1998 Oz agreement pays an escort` 0 EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `the hours annex א' of the 1998 Oz agreement pays an escort` 3 EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the hours annex א' of the 1998 Oz agreement pays an escort` 5 EQUALS 0

-- F-oz-1998-a's evidence: read as printed, each row from its first hour to
-- its last, both in, an activity ending at 15:00, 18:00 or 21:00 is in two
-- rows.
DECLARE `row of the 1998 table as printed` HAS
    `from the hour` IS A NUMBER
    `to the hour`   IS A NUMBER
    `its units`     IS A NUMBER

`the rows the 1998 table prints` MEANS
    LIST (`row of the 1998 table as printed` OF 14, 15, 0.5),
         (`row of the 1998 table as printed` OF 15, 18, 2),
         (`row of the 1998 table as printed` OF 18, 21, 3.5),
         (`row of the 1998 table as printed` OF 21, 24, 5)

GIVEN h IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the printed 1998 rows holding an end at` h IS
    count (filter (GIVEN r YIELD h AT LEAST r's `from the hour` AND h AT MOST r's `to the hour`) `the rows the 1998 table prints`)

`an activity ending at 15:00 is in two rows of the 1998 table` MEANS
        `the printed 1998 rows holding an end at` 15 EQUALS 2
    AND `the printed 1998 rows holding an end at` 18 EQUALS 2
    AND `the printed 1998 rows holding an end at` 21 EQUALS 2
    AND `the units a 1998 activity earns` (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 15) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `an activity ending at 15:00 is in two rows of the 1998 table`

-- F-oz-1998-b's evidence: no row holds an activity ending at 00:30, one
-- minute past 23:59's 5 units; the reading gives it the last row's.
`the 1998 table stops at midnight` MEANS
        NOT `the 1998 table has a row for an activity ending at` 24.5
    AND `the 1998 table has a row for an activity ending at` 23.99
    AND `the units a 1998 activity earns` (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 24.5)
            EQUALS `the units a 1998 activity earns` (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 23.99)
#ASSERT `the 1998 table stops at midnight`
